1168	   * <p>Since {@code Type} is not parameterized by T, this method is not type-safe and should be
1169	   * used carefully. If you are creating the {@code Type} from a {@link TypeToken}, prefer using
1170	   * {@link #fromJson(JsonElement, TypeToken)} instead since its return type is based on the {@code
1171	   * TypeToken} and is therefore more type-safe.
1172	   *
